'''The King & The Maiden''' (伯爵と乙女, ''Hakushaku to Otome'', '''Count and Maiden''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Sequential Advent Stage|Sequential Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 10.6 Update|Version 10.6]]. It has one stage, with an extra [[Continuation Stage]] that grants 3 Legend [[Catseye]]s as a [[Catnip Challenges|Catnip Challenge]] reward. These stages are exact copies of [[N-1 Grand Prix (Deadly)|N-1 Grand Prix]] and [[Bombergirl (Deadly)|Bombergirl]] respectively.

